<title>USA: Key IMM currencies end lower amid strong US assets.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currencies end lower amid strong US assets.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 22 - Key IMM currency futures ended lower as the U.S. dollar, stocks and bonds firmed. &quot;Basically the dollar took back what it gave up yesterday,&quot; one IMM trader said. He called action light overall, though some noted a large all-or-none sell order in June yen late. June Swiss tumbles to $0.6878.</p>
